Modifications made by this project
----------------------------------
The PE downlevel patch (scripts/build-portable.ps1 + tools/pe_downlevel.py)
modifies the COFF optional header of eight x64 binaries produced by upstream:

  * MajorOperatingSystemVersion / MinorOperatingSystemVersion   10.0 -> 6.1
  * MajorSubsystemVersion        / MinorSubsystemVersion        10.0 -> 6.1

This invalidates Authenticode signatures on those files. The patch is reversible:
tools/pe_downlevel.py writes a "<file>.orig-osver" backup before touching a file.
